export async function fetchMentorResource(url,{signal}={}){const r=await fetch(url,{signal});if(!r.ok)throw Error('资源载入失败：'+r.status);const total=r.headers.get('Content-Encoding')?0:Number(r.headers.get('Content-Length'))||0,id=new URL(url,typeof location!=='undefined'?location.href:'http://localhost/').pathname.slice(1);let loaded=0;const report=()=>{if(typeof window!=='undefined')window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('mentor-resource-progress',{detail:{id,loaded,total}}));};if(!r.body?.getReader){const bytes=await r.arrayBuffer();loaded=bytes.byteLength;report();return bytes;}const reader=r.body.getReader(),parts=[];try{for(;;){const part=await reader.read();if(part.done)break;parts.push(part.value);loaded+=part.value.byteLength;report();}}finally{reader.releaseLock();}const bytes=new Uint8Array(loaded);let offset=0;for(const part of parts){bytes.set(part,offset);offset+=part.byteLength;}report();return bytes.buffer;}
